200	96	Cách dùng & cấu trúc	Nhiều động từ, tính từ, danh từ đi với một giới từ cố định. Phải học theo cụm.\n\nĐộng từ: depend on, rely on, focus on, contribute to, lead to, result in, result from, benefit from, suffer from, invest in, participate in, consist of, deal with, cope with, protect sb from, prevent sb from + V-ing, apply for (a job), apply to (a university).\nTính từ: responsible for, aware of, capable of, dependent on, interested in, concerned about, famous for, different from, similar to, harmful to, addicted to.\nDanh từ: increase in, decrease in, rise in, fall in (Task 1: an increase IN sales; increased BY 10%; rose TO 50%), effect on, impact on, influence on, solution to, reason for, demand for, access to, attitude towards.\n\nLưu ý: discuss, emphasise, affect, reach, enter, approach KHÔNG có giới từ (sai: discuss about).	B2	1	2026-10-14 08:44:11.875341+00	2026-10-14 08:44:11.875341+00
