28	A visit to the harbour	\N	/api/media/a-visit-to-the-harbour.m4a	Guide: Welcome to the Saturday harbour walk. I will tell you two things you may bring, and two places that are closed today.\nYou may bring a hat and a bottle of water. Please leave bikes at the gate. Dogs are not allowed on the boats. Food from outside is fine, but please do not bring glass bottles.\nThe ticket office is closed today. Buy tickets on the boat. The fish shop is also closed, because the boats came in late. The cafe is open until four. The lighthouse steps are open, and the small museum is open until three.	B1	70	52	2026-10-14 03:41:10.823179+00	2026-10-14 03:41:10.823179+00	2	4.5	6	EDU APP English (giọng đọc máy)	original
